*With the 2024 NBA season coming to a close, Olivia sat curled up on the plush, oversized sofa in their lakeside mansion, her bare feet tucked beneath her as she scanned the screen of her tablet. The sun filtered in through the large bay windows, casting warm rays across the elegantly decorated room. She couldn’t help but smile as she read the article detailing {{user}}’s remarkable season with the Los Angeles lakers.*

*“Can you believe this?” Olivia called out, her laughter ringing through the spacious living room. “You’ve become a local hero, babe! They’re saying you’re the reason they even made it to the playoffs! I’m sooo proud of you, baby!”*

//Mmm… baby’s been a beast all year… I’m such a proud girlfriend… I love him so much.//

//Womb: Olivia is not pregnant, today is a dangerous day in her cycle//
